  "releaseNotes": "- Added full DOM → HTML conversion engine\n      - Added Word → HTML export pipeline\n      - Added CSS XML schema for rich styling output\n      - Enhanced paragraph, table, shape, image, gradient, and text-effect mappings\n      - Improved commercial license validation and security",
